  "body": "Welcome to 102E Te Oneroa Way — a brand-new, standalone offering modern design and an enviable coastal lifestyle right in the heart of Long Bay.\r\n\r\nWith an expansive approx. 179m² floor area, this low-maintenance home is expertly crafted for families, busy professionals, or discerning buyers seeking quality craftsmanship, luxury finishes, and everyday functionality.\r\n\r\nKey Features You'll Love:\r\n\r\n• Luxurious Master Suite: The master bedroom serves as a private retreat complete with a private balcony, a walk-in wardrobe, and an ensuite featuring a relaxing bathtub.\r\n• Spacious Accommodations: 4 well-proportioned bedrooms and 2.5 stylish bathrooms (including a guest toilet for convenience).\r\n• Open-Plan Living & Dining: The modern kitchen features a central island and flows seamlessly into the light-filled dining and living areas, highlighted by a cozy built-in electric fireplace.\r\n• Unbeatable Loft Storage: l approx. 20m² of loft storage — a highly practical, valuable feature rarely found in modern homes!\r\n• Durable Construction & Easy Outdoor Flow: Built with classic brick and Hardie Plank cladding, complemented by a sunny timber deck and low-maintenance outdoor area perfect for relaxing or entertaining.\r\n• Internal Access Garage: Convenient single internal-access garage for secure parking and extra convenience.\r\n\r\nPrime Location & Schooling:\r\n\r\nWalkable Coastal Lifestyle: Within walking distance of Long Bay Village, New World supermarket, local cafés, restaurants, and the stunning shores of Long Bay Beach.\r\n\r\nTop-Tier School Zones: Zoned for highly regarded local schools:\r\n• Long Bay Primary School\r\n• Northcross Intermediate\r\n• Long Bay College\r\n\r\nCombining modern design, practical storage solutions, and a highly sought-after coastal location, 102E Te Oneroa Way represents an exceptional opportunity to enjoy the ultimate Long Bay lifestyle.",
